{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（23日）早上接近7時，警方接報，將軍澳清水灣半島對開，一名男子在海面載浮載沉。消防員到場將事主救起，91歲姓李事主陷入昏迷，由救護車送往將軍澳醫院搶救，其後被證實死亡。警方於現場沒有檢獲遺書，墮海原因仍有待調查。</p><p>現場消息指，今早有晨運客發現一名老翁在水中漂浮，遂報警求助。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防救起事主。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168100625817276416962708.jpeg/2F50hShBik_nqzl4tGQOkTn3PHuqQDhEtIL-lrSC_pY\"/><figcaption>消防救起事主。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方、消防及救援人員到場。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168099228409663488837049.jpeg/JYxgCw6elrJ0lxSE6YtggX4Tb06VHADQFMCi3jHAot4\"/><figcaption>警方、消防及救援人員到場。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救援人員為事主進行急救。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168099225779703808796102.jpeg/OHvmu_WDLyW9clxTERr-4snfLXpcxm8GXSsOZngrDmY\"/><figcaption>救援人員為事主進行急救。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救援人員為事主進行急救。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168099222784839680273864.jpeg/nZoxa-JtZ_gIUBPVw7T3UEUZfFnIV3EJ3DbkM_k25DM\"/><figcaption>救援人員為事主進行急救。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168100628195577856572914.jpeg/SZhyL0ckpQW0AnQx6GMROOpkHeoGgbtQKbsPsQy7D7E\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T05:57:49.926224+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}